      ],
      "source": "https://www.believehardscape.com/onalaska-wi-history-geography-community-overview/",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Onalaska sits on a slightly elevated ridge above the Black River, surrounded by river bottom land and heavily wooded bluffs that offer scenic views.",
